Z||000009||camon||10-28-2001||11:34 PM||||dslice:<P>Thanks for that little piece of info about the battery.<P>I too was having a squealing noise (it would come and go). It did it like 3 weeks ago for like a day or so then it stopped. Ran good for about 3 or 4 days then it returned so I tried to WD-40 the alternator shaft thinking the squeal was coming from there and it seemed to take away. Well Friday it returned and only lasted 1 day (Saturday it was fine again). Well Sunday night I was working on the stereo (in the dark) and had my interior lights on and running juice from the battery to power the stereo got everything back togather and I went for a drive and it returned again. Well I came to this topic and seen your post and I think this is my problem. Going to get anew battery tommorow (I know it probably needs it anyway because it cranks slow some mornings).<P>Thanks!<P>------------------<BR>Keith||||reg||10
